title: The Borderlands and the Minorities
subtitle: The Interior: minority languages in the offices, the voivodeship self-government, the eastern border.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'minorities_kresy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.minorities_kresy (technical reference 17.12.6). Opening and closing the card are free; a confirmed option
// costs this month's action. Z — 0.99 (the sketch and the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026, 2B and 3A): the self-government needs no
// promise to the minorities; one gain and one cost each.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'minorities_kresy');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_kresy');
!}

= The Borderlands and the minorities

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The minorities in the east want to deal with the offices in their own language and to govern themselves, and the eastern border has to be guarded. The discontent of the minorities stands at [+ pl_gc_minorities +] of 100.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @official_languages
- @self_government
- @border
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@official_languages
title: Introduce minority languages in the offices
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. The minorities trust PPS more (+3), but the National Democrats protest (−5). [? if pl_minorities_kresy_official_languages_coalition : [+ pl_minorities_kresy_official_languages_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'minorities_kresy', 'official_languages').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_minorities_kresy_official_languages_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'minorities_kresy', 'official_languages');
!}
go-to: result

@self_government
title: Carry out the act on the voivodeship self-government
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. The discontent of the minorities of the area falls (−3), but the National Democrats protest (−5). [? if pl_minorities_kresy_self_government_coalition : [+ pl_minorities_kresy_self_government_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'minorities_kresy', 'self_government').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_minorities_kresy_self_government_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'minorities_kresy', 'self_government');
!}
go-to: result

@border
title: Strengthen the protection of the eastern border
subtitle: Cost: [+ pl_cost2 +]. Political violence falls (−3), but the minorities trust PPS less (−3). [? if pl_minorities_kresy_border_coalition : [+ pl_minorities_kresy_border_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'minorities_kresy', 'border').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_minorities_kresy_border_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'minorities_kresy', 'border');
!}
go-to: result

